  "caveats": [
    "VPR process after identical input pre-read; pack/place excluded and fixed; RRG XML load, lookahead, routing, native FULL and STA included. Independent original readback reported separately in workflow. Pipeline-study variants all serialize a wire map inside process timing; every map is checked against original serial bytes, at every core count.",
    "Uses four physical cores44..47 after completed CLSTM quality confirmation; other studies may overlap on disjoint CPU sets, shared host/memory.",
    "One exploratory attribution triple, not a performance confirmation. refactored and tasks have exactly the same SHA/binary bytes (hardlink aliases), differing only in pipeline activation. optimized retains the earlier sample-parallel binary.",
    "Build-cache improvements are not routing-kernel acceleration; cache reuse is provided equally.",
    "Failed routes are excluded from speedup ratios and remain part of the robustness result."
  ]
}
